    "text": "The total number of unpaired electrons present in the complex <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Cr</mi><mo>(</mo><mtext>oxalate</mtext><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is______.",
